COMMUNITY PARTICIPATION
Article 38
(1) The community participates and plays a role in the implementation of protection for Victims.
(2) Community participation as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be in the form of forming/establishing:
   a. partner families at the village/kelurahan level;
   b. women and children protection units in community organizations;
   c. independently conducting socialization of women's and children's rights;
   d. providing first aid to victims; and
So that everyone may know of it, it is ordered by Regional Regulation (PERATU... Daerah) on PROTECT... (PERLIND...).

Article 36
